---
// Footer strip listing <PointOfContact> children, with a catch-all line for everything else.
---

<section class="border-t border-line py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5">
    <h2 class="label">Project points of contact</h2>
    <ul class="mt-6 border-b border-line text-alice">
      <slot />
      <li class="grid gap-1 border-t border-line py-3 md:grid-cols-[13rem_minmax(0,1fr)] md:gap-10">
        <strong class="font-semibold text-white">Everything else</strong>
        <span>Reach out through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, or see who leads what on the <a href="/people">People page</a>.</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
